+## Existing pending invoice items 
+
+When a subscription update generates an invoice, it might include invoice items that were already pending depending on the subscription’s billing mode:
+
+- **Flexible:** Subscription update invoices normally include eligible pending invoice items. However, when you use `payment_behavior=pending_if_incomplete`, the invoice excludes pre-existing pending invoice items, including when you reset the billing cycle anchor. These items remain pending for later invoicing.
+- **Classic:** Invoices generated by a billing cycle anchor reset include eligible pending invoice items. Other update invoices generated with `proration_behavior=always_invoice` exclude pre-existing pending invoice items when the update itself produces invoice items, such as prorations.